- lineage/provenance;
- retention/deletion;
- leakage e negative tests;
- external-source licensing/terms;
- change trigger.", "Apply the gate before connection and whenever material source or context change occurs.", "Authorization must be enforced before retrieval.", "Test segregation, leakage and deletion propagation and record external-source license/terms."]

